    "directions": [
      "Knead the dough using whole wheat flour, refined flour, sugar, vinegar and salt. Dough has to be semi soft. Keep aside to rest for 30 minutes.",
      "Meanwhile, to make the filling in a mixing bowl, add all the ingredients and mix well.",
      "Once the dough has finished resting, lightly flour the work surface and roll out the dough into medium size thin disk. Stuff the filling into it, give it a desired shape and keep aside.",
      "Steam the momos for 15 minutes in the steamer.",
      "Remove and serve immediately with momo chutney.",
      "For momo chutney, heat oil in pan, add tomatoes, Kashmiri red chillies, salt and water. Allow it to cook for 5-6 minutes.",
      "Meanwhile, in another pan dry roast peanuts and coriander seeds for 2-3 minutes.",
      "Into a blender add tomatoes along with its remaining water, prepared peanut mixture, garlic cloves and blend it into a smooth paste."
    ],
